    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 17.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Sece man his hundred. Séce man hundredes gemót be wíte, ealswa hit riht is to secanne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Everyone shall attend his hundred [court]. Everyone shall attend the hundred court, under pain of fine, whenever he is required by law to attend it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And sece man hundredes gemot be wíte, eallswa hit is to secenne.</ab>
      </div>
